  "reference_solution": "SELECT a.account_id FROM billing_accounts a WHERE NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM invoices i WHERE i.account_id=a.account_id AND i.period=DATE '2026-09-01' AND i.status='settled')",
  "solution_explanation": "Use existence of the complete matching predicate. NOT IN is vulnerable to NULL child keys, while an anti-existence test preserves unmatched accounts.",
